abstract: Fifteen multilingual interactive AI playgrounds with standalone offline HTML downloads. v1.9.3 restores language and guided controls and the correct featured experiments at original-lab directory URLs, and retains the Wumpus World icon key and responsive percept icons. Human learner, educator, and screen-reader validation is deferred; no WCAG conformance or validated learning-outcome claim is made.
